#: Youtube_settings.py:308
msgid ""
"How to get YouTube cookies:\n"
"\n"
"1. Install 'Get cookies.txt' extension in Chrome or Firefox\n"
"2. Login to YouTube in your browser\n"
"3. Click the extension icon and export cookies\n"
"4. Save as cookies.txt and select it here\n"
"\n"
"Using cookies helps avoid blocks because YouTube sees you as a logged-in user.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sådan henter du YouTube-cookies:\n"
"\n"
"1. Installer udvidelsen 'Get cookies.txt' i Chrome eller Firefox\n"
"2. Log ind på YouTube i din browser\n"
"3. Klik på udvidelsesikonet og eksporter cookies\n"
"4. Gem som cookies.txt og vælg den her\n"
"\n"
"Brug af cookies hjælper med at undgå blokeringer, da YouTube ser dig som en logget ind bruger.\n"

